# UAT static deploy: only the exported web app is uploaded.
# Everything else (source, node_modules, other apps/packages, logs, images)
# must never enter the upload, which previously scanned the whole monorepo.
# The export script (`export:web`) writes to dist-web, and vercel.json's
# `outputDirectory` is dist-web — keep these three in lockstep.
*
!dist-web/**
